Third-party licences for this bundle
=====================================

This bundle's source archive holds Carbon's own glue code (carbon_candidate/) and the third-party components listed
below; the pinned wheels (if any) are installed beside it. This file reproduces the licences of those third-party
components, unmodified. It is not a licence for Carbon's own code.

Used from the base worker image, not vendored here: neuraloperator 2.0.0 (MIT) with torch (BSD-3-Clause and others), tensorly, tensorly-torch, einops.
